WRONGFUL USE WARNING
================================================================================

This notice is a condition of use, not legal advice. Read it before running
anything in this repository.

This software archives other people's private conversations. That is its
entire function. The messages it collects were written by real people who did
not agree to have them stored, indexed, searched, exported. Use this tool at
your own discretion. 



LEGAL EXPOSURE IS YOURS ALONE

  Automating a user account against Discord's API violates the Discord Terms
  of Service and can get your account permanently terminated. Depending on
  where you and the people you collect from live, mass collection and
  retention of private messages may also engage data-protection law (such as
  the GDPR or CCPA), wiretap and interception statutes, computer-misuse law,
  and civil liability for invasion of privacy.

  You are solely responsible for how you use this software and for everything
